Source: https://github.com/stumarti/Enigma2-Bouquet-to-M3U
License: MIT
Section: extra
Priority: optional
Description: Export a bouquet as M3U playlist + XMLTV EPG for IPTV apps
 Exports a chosen Enigma 2 bouquet as an M3U playlist and an XMLTV
 EPG file, served over HTTP on the LAN. Useful for pointing third-
 party IPTV players (TiviMate, IPTV Smarters, Jellyfin, etc.) at
 the box's live tuners.
Depends: enigma2, enigma2-plugin-extensions-openwebif, python3-core
